# Tabs (actions/actions_tabs.iface.kbd)
**tabs + spc**      -- Select Tabs Not Implemented
**tabs + l**        -- Next
**tabs + h**        -- Prev
**tabs + j**        -- Select First Tab Not Implemented
**tabs + up**       -- Select Last Tab Not Implemented
**tabs + t**        -- New
**tabs + vertical** -- Tabs Vertical Not Implemented
**tabs + w**        -- Close
**tabs + lsft + t** -- Undo Close
**tabs + 1**        -- Goto 1
**tabs + 2**        -- Goto 2
**tabs + 3**        -- Goto 3
**tabs + 4**        -- Goto 4
**tabs + 5**        -- Goto 5
**tabs + 6**        -- Goto 6
**tabs + 7**        -- Goto 7
**tabs + 8**        -- Goto 8
**tabs + 9**        -- Goto Last
**tabs + toggle**   -- Toggle Recent Tab Not Implemented
**tabs + move + h** -- Move Tab Left Not Implemented
**tabs + move + l** -- Move Tab Right Not Implemented
**tabs + move + j** -- Move Tab First Not Implemented
**tabs + move + k** -- Move Tab Last Not Implemented
